 de zhù zài jǐ lóu?","speaker":"M"},"options":[{"zh":"三楼","pinyin":"Sān lóu"},{"zh":"四楼","pinyin":"Sì lóu"},{"zh":"五楼","pinyin":"Wǔ lóu"}],"answer":2},{"audio":[{"zh":"医生说你的身体怎么样？","pinyin":"Yīshēng shuō nǐ de shēntǐ zěnmeyàng?","speaker":"F"},{"zh":"没什么问题，休息几天就好了。","pinyin":"Méi shénme wèntí, xiūxi jǐ tiān jiù hǎo le.","speaker":"M"}],"question":{"zh":"医生让男的做什么？","pinyin":"Yīshēng ràng nán de zuò shénme?","speaker":"F"},"options":[{"zh":"休息几天","pinyin":"Xiūxi jǐ tiān"},{"zh":"去医院","pinyin":"Qù yīyuàn"},{"zh":"吃很多药","pinyin":"Chī hěn duō yào"}],"answer":0},{"audio":[{"zh":"这个星期天你去哪儿玩？","pinyin":"Zhège xīngqītiān nǐ qù nǎr wán?","speaker":"M"},{"zh":"我想在家看书，哪儿也不去。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng zài jiā kàn shū, nǎr yě bú qù.","speaker":"F"}],"question":{"zh":"女的星期天要做什么？","pinyin":"Nǚ de xīngqītiān yào zuò shénme?","speaker":"M"},"options":[{"zh":"出去玩","pinyin":"Chūqù wán"},{"zh":"在家看书","pinyin":"Zài jiā kàn shū"},{"zh":"去朋友家","pinyin":"Qù péngyou jiā"}],"answer":1}]},{"slug":"c-r1-01","part":"R1","images":["call","read","money","bed","flower","milk"],"example":{"stimulus":{"zh":"我在给我的老师打电话。","pinyin":"Wǒ zài gěi wǒ de lǎoshī dǎ diànhuà."},"answer":0},"items":[{"text":{"zh":"爸爸坐在椅子上看书。","pinyin":"Bàba zuò zài yǐzi shàng kàn shū."},"answer":1},{"text":{"zh":"这些钱是我给你的。","pinyin":"Zhèxiē qián shì wǒ gěi nǐ de."},"answer":2},{"text":{"zh":"太晚了，快去睡觉吧。","pinyin":"Tài wǎn le, kuài qù shuìjiào ba."},"answer":3},{"text":{"zh":"这些花真好看，是谁送的？","pinyin":"Zhèxiē huā zhēn hǎokàn, shì shéi sòng de?"},"answer":4},{"text":{"zh":"孩子们每天都要喝牛奶。","pinyin":"Háizimen měi tiān dōu yào hē niúnǎi."},"answer":5}]},{"slug":"c-r2-01","part":"R2","bank":[{"zh":"最","pinyin":"Zuì"},{"zh":"件","pinyin":"Jiàn"},{"zh":"知道","pinyin":"Zhīdào"},{"zh":"从","pinyin":"Cóng"},{"zh":"次","pinyin":"Cì"},{"zh":"真","pinyin":"Zhēn"}],"example":{"text":{"zh":"我（ ）喜欢的水果是苹果。","pinyin":"Wǒ xǐhuan de shuǐguǒ shì píngguǒ."},"answer":0},"items":[{"text":{"zh":"这（ ）衣服是妈妈给我买的。","pinyin":"Zhè yīfu shì māma gěi wǒ mǎi de."},"answer":1},{"text":{"zh":"你（ ）他住在哪儿吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ tā zhù zài nǎr ma?"},"answer":2},{"text":{"zh":"他（ ）中国来，是我的新同学。","pinyin":"Tā Zhōngguó lái, shì wǒ de xīn tóngxué."},"answer":3},{"text":{"zh":"这个电影我看过两（ ）。","pinyin":"Zhège diànyǐng wǒ kàn guo liǎng."},"answer":4},{"text":{"zh":"A：这是我做的菜。B：（ ）好吃！","pinyin":"A: Zhè shì wǒ zuò de cài. B: Hǎochī!"},"answer":5}]},{"slug":"c-r3-01","part":"R3","bank":[{"zh":"是的，我们是同学。","pinyin":"Shì de, wǒmen shì tóngxué."},{"zh":"我在学校门口。","pinyin":"Wǒ zài xuéxiào ménkǒu."},{"zh":"下午三点。","pinyin":"Xiàwǔ sān diǎn."},{"zh":"不太好，有点儿冷。","pinyin":"Bú tài hǎo, yǒudiǎnr lěng."},{"zh":"我想喝水。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng hē shuǐ."},{"zh":"我坐出租车去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zuò chūzūchē qù."}],"example":{"text":{"zh":"你们认识吗？","pinyin":"Nǐmen rènshi ma?"},"answer":0},"items":[{"text":{"zh":"你在哪儿呢？我怎么看不到你？","pinyin":"Nǐ zài nǎr ne? Wǒ zěnme kàn bú dào nǐ?"},"answer":1},{"text":{"zh":"考试是什么时候？","pinyin":"Kǎoshì shì shénme shíhou?"},"answer":2},{"text":{"zh":"今天天气怎么样？","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì zěnmeyàng?"},"answer":3},{"text":{"zh":"你要吃什么吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào chī shénme ma?"},"answer":4},{"text":{"zh":"你怎么去机场？","pinyin":"Nǐ zěnme qù jīchǎng?"},"answer":5}]},{"slug":"c-r3-02","part":"R3","bank":[{"zh":"他去中国了。","pinyin":"Tā qù Zhōngguó le."},{"zh":"好的，我开车去机场。","pinyin":"Hǎo de, wǒ kāichē qù jīchǎng."},{"zh":"我也觉得很好看。","pinyin":"Wǒ yě juéde hěn hǎokàn."},{"zh":"三个人：爸爸、妈妈和我。","pinyin":"Sān gè rén: bàba, māma hé wǒ."},{"zh":"对不起，我不知道。","pinyin":"Duìbuqǐ, wǒ bù zhīdào."}],"items":[{"text":{"zh":"这个电影真好看！","pinyin":"Zhège diànyǐng zhēn hǎokàn!"},"answer":2},{"text":{"zh":"你家有几口人？","pinyin":"Nǐ jiā yǒu jǐ kǒu rén?"},"answer":3},{"text":{"zh":"请问，火车站在哪儿？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn, huǒchē zhàn zài nǎr?"},"answer":4},{"text":{"zh":"我八点到机场。","pinyin":"Wǒ bā diǎn dào jīchǎng."},"answer":1},{"text":{"zh":"你哥哥呢？好长时间没看见他了。","pinyin":"Nǐ gēge ne? Hǎo cháng shíjiān méi kànjiàn tā le."},"answer":0}]},{"slug":"c-r4-01","part":"R4","items":[{"passage":{"zh":"我每天晚上都去跑步，跑一个小时，现在身体很好。","pinyin":"Wǒ měi tiān wǎnshang 